		<elementInformation name="description" show="1">Shunt trip release MX for ComPacT NSX, PowerPact Multistandard and EasyPact CVS, 220-240 V AC 50/60 Hz (208-277 V AC 60 Hz), screwless spring terminal connections, opens the circuit breaker when the control voltage exceeds 70 % of Un (IEC 60947-2). Coil terminals C1-C2 ASSUMED.</elementInformation>
	</elementInformations>
